# Title: Potential SPN Enumeration Via Setspn.EXE
# ID: 1eeed653-dbc8-4187-ad0c-eeebb20e6599
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Markus Neis, keepwatch
# Date: 2018-11-14
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1558.003
# Description: Detects service principal name (SPN) enumeration used for Kerberoasting
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN " -q " OR CommandLine CONTAIN " /q ")) AND ((Image="*\\setspn.exe") OR (OriginalFileName = "setspn.exe") OR ((Description CONTAIN "Query or reset the computer" AND Description CONTAIN "SPN attribute"))))
